ontents": {"content": "reschedule the meeting to another date but forgot to call her.", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 9, "template_override": 2}, {"type": "RSLT", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"id": 1, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 10, "template_override": 1}, {"type": "DWS", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nFind out how much exercise you get when you do housework.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn9le07ob07re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 11, "template_override": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "stimuli": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}]}, {"type": "audio", "_data": [], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "image": "engenn9le07ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"text": "Dear Sally,<br/>\nI've been reading your blogs for a long time and find them entertaining and insightful. I was wondering if you could help me. I live with three other people who are not very tidy. They don't clean up after themselves like they are supposed to.  This isn't acceptable, is it? I prefer things to be orderly and tidy. Can you please give me some advice on how to cope with this problem?<br/>\nThanks,<br/>\nMaria", "image": "engenn9le07ob07re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"text": "Dear Maria,<br/>\nThank you for being such an avid blog follower and writing to me. It looks like you have a lot on your plate cleaning up after three other people.\nFirst, I want to make some things clear. You were not supposed to take on all the chores.  You are not responsible for cleaning up after your housemates. They said they were going to deal with their own mess. They need to be reminded of that as soon as possible. I would suggest holding a house meeting where you discuss chore responsibilities as a group. Explain that you are not going to clean up after them, that the house cannot always be a mess.", "image": "engenn9le07ob07re2img02.jpg", "time": "26000", "id": 2}, {"text": "You should decide together what each person is supposed to do during the week. This sort of thing was supposed to happen when you first moved in together, but if it were going to happen now it could still work. If they do not want to clean, suggest they chip in for a cleaning service. I think this is going to be good place to start. Let me know what happens.<br/>\nRegards,<br/>\nSally", "image": "engenn9le07ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "62000", "id": 3}], "coverimg": "engenn9le07ob07re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le07ob07re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}]}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Sharing the Housework", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Wasn't It Your Turn?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Describe ways of solving problems and getting things done in social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Explaining How Things Were Done", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "  You use <span class=\"italic\">be supposed to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">was going</span> to to explain how things were done.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the structure <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to </span>when you want to talk about expectations, obligations or arrangements. You can use this structure using the Past tense to talk about things that you were obligated to do, but didn't or couldn't do. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure is: <br /><br /> Subject + To be +<span class=\"italic\"> supposed to</span> + verb <br /><br /> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">This sort of thing was supposed to happen</span> when you first moved in together.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "**Pronunciation tip**:<br /> When you say be supposed to, you link the /d/ and /t/ sounds together.  <br /><br /> Like this: Be suppose_to", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the structure<span class=\"strong\"> was going to </span> when you want to talk about things that you had planned or intended to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure is:<br /><br />  <span class=\"italic\">was</span>/<span class=\"italic\">were </span>+ <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> + verb <br /><br />  <span class=\"italic\">They said <span class=\"strong\">they were going to deal with</span> their own mess.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "This sort of thing was supposed to happen when you first moved in together.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You were not supposed to take on all the chores.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They said they were going to deal with their own mess.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Position of <span class=\"italic\">Not</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to emphasize that something or an action is opposite to what is expected, use <span class=\"italic\">not</span>, rather than a contraction in the sentence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I live with three other people who are <span class=\"strong\">not</span> very tidy.<br/>You were <span class=\"strong\">not</span> supposed to take on all the chores.  </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The <span class=\"strong\">not</span> shows a firmness on the part of the speaker while still being polite.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When speaking, the <span class=\"strong\">not</span> is pronounced louder and longer than it is normally. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain that you are not going to clean after them, and that the house cannot always be a mess. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If they do not want to clean, suggest they chip in for a cleaning service.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You were not supposed to take on all the chores. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to have a lot on your plate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have too many responsibilities at one time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It looks like you have a lot on your plate cleaning up after three other people. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to write a complaint letter about housemates.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "acceptable ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "capable or worthy of being accepted", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This isn't acceptable, is it? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "entertaining ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "amusing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've been reading your blogs for a long time and find them entertaining and insightful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "insightful ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having or showing a deep understanding or  perspective", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I've been reading your blogs for a long time and find them entertaining and insightful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "avid ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "showing great interest in", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thank you for being such an avid blog follower and writing to me. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to deal with", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take action on", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They said they were going to deal with their own mess. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to chip in", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to contribute money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They chip in for a cleaning service.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go to the library or online to read articles about about housework, exercise and calorie burning.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take notes as you read at least two articles (in English).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a summary for each of the articles.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your summaries to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss the ideas from the article.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I read about domestic activities and exercise.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write up summaries of two articles.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain how to burn calories or get exercise while doing housework.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my findings with a partner and discuss them.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le07ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}]}